OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start to the day, but
OL,6,Fcloud breaking through the morning
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. Scattered showers
OL,8,Farriving from the northwest during the
OL,9,Fday, can be heavy at times with the
OL,10,Fodd rumble of thunder. Feeling fresher
OL,11,Fthan recent days.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continuing in places
OL,14,Fwithin the northwesterly breeze, gusty
OL,15,Faround coastal areas. Turning cloudier
OL,16,Fovernight, feeling cooler than
OL,17,Fprevious nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
